# [01] Personal editor state and local machine settings do not belong in the shared project.
.idea/
**/.idea/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
local.properties
**/local.properties
**/xcuserdata/
apps/ios/Configuration/Local.xcconfig

# [02] Keep generated builds, caches and test bundles out; source and database migrations stay visible.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/DerivedData/
*.xcresult/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/node_modules/
.dfe-*/

# [03] Signing keys, certificates and device profiles stay with their approved local owner.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.key
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# [04] Old packages and working evidence stay outside the source repository.
report/backups/
docs/evidence/
*.zip
*.bak
*.backup
*~

# [05] Compiler scratch files can be recreated locally.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# [06] Academic reports, access requests and local audit records stay outside this code branch.
docs/pa/
docs/apple/
docs/validation/

# [07] Platform tools can recreate these local editor and native-build files.
*.iml
**/captures/
**/.externalNativeBuild/
**/.cxx/
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
